  "location": 2,
  "content": "我可能会有不愉快的体验",
  "music": 0.0
 },
 {
  "from": 476.94,
  "to": 478.16,
  "sid": 213,
  "location": 2,
  "content": "这个信念为例",
  "music": 0.0
 },
 {
  "from": 478.16,
  "to": 480.62,
  "sid": 214,
  "location": 2,
  "content": "在第一天按照自己平时的做法",
  "music": 0.0
 },
 {
  "from": 480.62,
  "to": 483.24,
  "sid": 215,
  "location": 2,
  "content": "尽可能地做出前面提到的安全行为",
  "music": 0.0
 },
 {
  "from": 483.24,
  "to": 484.83,
  "sid": 216,
  "location": 2,
  "content": "让自己尽情焦虑",
  "music": 0.0
 },
 {
  "from": 484.83,
  "to": 486.02,
  "sid": 217,
  "location": 2,
  "content": "一天结束后",
  "music": 0.0
 },
 {
  "from": 486.02,
  "to": 489.44,
  "sid": 218,
  "location": 2,
  "content": "写下自己在经历跟这个信念相关的所有事件后",
  "music": 0.0
 },
 {
  "from": 489.44,
  "to": 490.46,
  "sid": 219,
  "location": 2,
  "content": "的整体感受",
  "music": 0.0
 },
 {
  "from": 490.46,
  "to": 492.32,
  "sid": 220,
  "location": 2,
  "content": "以及今天是否愉悦",
  "music": 0.0
 },
 {
  "from": 492.32,
  "to": 495.86,
  "sid": 221,
  "location": 2,
  "content": "但到了第二天需要克制自己大量搜寻信息",
  "music": 0.0
 },
 {
  "from": 495.86,
